Nonkantakero aka okimitaka aka, aikiro nojatatyero nontyero, osantsatapake ovirapakya aka, nampinaikajero aka, nontzimaityaaro aka.
Iroñaaka shiramparika yaanakiro eentsi irojatzi opashitziki shina.
Nopasakataki, te naye osheki, naake apite, intaani iitsoki, nomishiyavaishitari osheki.
Ora Anampitsiteasaekantari anijantero aisati aminero anintaro aisati aminero ametakotero ashitari nijasato amakotaro okantashitya okameetsati, osaikakotanakera osaekika.
Yookaitanakiri irirori ipiyatsata, eero ipiyatsatami, eero yookaitzirimi.
Pibitirieri jamani itonkakeri pabachori.
Nayiro aisatzi aitaki osaikiri anta yantajetzinta nokonkiri itotzi, shiringa itotziri.
Ovatsikaki aparoni chakopi, okimiro ton, okimiro ten.
Abakojetiro20°. AnteriApotojeitani Jebatantsi
Osaekakotsi II JEBABENTIRORI ANAMPIKE NIJA
Okoyaati choeni machaki otsapiaki ochera eniki.
Ratsikakeri cheenkari otsiti abotsiki.
Okantakena nana: Pichenkotya intsipaite aatatyeri areetyabo pitsiro.
Okanta, okanta, okantakiri iyaariri: “Yaya, paitakatya antakinarika nomotyaki?”
Nonkinkitsakotya ikanta itzimi neentsite.
Itobakaakenabo konki meshiyanto.
Osheki itsarovanitzi, te iyonite imanatya.
Ipantsai mamaro,
Iroma iroka ponchakirontzi ikantaitziro ikyaashivaimento.
“Tsika ikantzika nosari?”
Robakari matsontsori otyaapate isheeni.
Parivana opaita, oyomitanaro ishani, pinkantero ishapita.
Piyate pimpichero iroka kamantaantsi ipankoki pinkatsari.
15. Akakotero obirara inintakaro opoñantari otsinamankori; aisati
Jebabentirori Anampi Ikobiri Jebatirori Pashinesato osankinatakota otimantyari yaminakoetiro yakotero nija otenkana opoñayetanta.
Akobakaeri irayiro nija timatsi obira omonkarata ipantaeterori kantakobentantsi apite osarentsi (2) Jebabentirori Anampi onintakaro obakotachari okarate yayiri nija okantya otimantyari aero okibitya nija:
Inkentakerika kontsaroraja, kamaki, jaitetzi, ishitovanaki, yaapainteri.
Ojampiti ebankabo: ¿Ayiini, jempe ikenanake pitomi?
Antari noonki rankobiitakeri maniro raakeri ocheraaki.
“Pimairete.”
